    {
      "id": 228754,
      "name": "of the twilight the darkness",
      "username": "of_the_twilight_the_darkness",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/of_the_twilight_the_darkness/{size}/1955_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-09-30T21:02:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>he is using the weapon because it fused to him when he touched it and he can't let go of it&nbsp;and it wants to be used. not that it is truly sentient, its power just wants to be used. Also, he can slowly recuperate after using his sword if he doesn't use it for a while. Its just if he were to use it a lot for a long time that he would die.</p>",
